      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pain is an indicator of the quality of care, especially in intensive care. It gives rise to a questioning of practices. It requires formalised measures and standardised methods as well as a common language within the teams. The assessment and management of pain is multidisciplinary and responsibility is shared."},
